  "synopsis": [
    {
      "langue": "en",
      "text": "This is the first time Mike Vincent have tried to edit a game, and with zero programming skills it wasn’t easy. But with some help from MegaFLE X and Matrix, he was able to anyway. There are some KNOWN bugs in this hack, because of limited knowledge of ASM, he wasn’t able to fix everything.\r\n\r\nDon’t get confused by the name, it doesn’t have anything to do with the Mavericks. There is no story line in this game, no intro or anything. It’s just a game!\r\n\r\nThe bosses and enemies are generally the same, but the levels have been completely changed, as have some of the graphics\r\n\r\nHappy gaming! :)"
    }
  ],
